        <mxCell id="c60" value="&lt;i&gt;Each row is the calendar year of its promotion, January to December. The recorded window is drawn 14 to 40 px wide so that it shows: its end falls on its start date, 2 days before its start and 1 day before its start. Every line of each promotion was ordered after its recorded end and invoiced in the months that followed.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="362" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
